flowchart LR
	SHEMA["The factory's Schema(false, {...}) helper -<br/>validates and fills every default at load."]
	SHEMA --> VOL["Every knob volatile - a flip lands<br/>on the next assembly, no remounting"]
	SHEMA --> VALID["Fail-loud validation in apply"]
	VALID -. "Invalid config" .-> THROW["Throws at load -<br/>never silently defaults"]
	VALID --> RULES["sectionName and separator non-empty,<br/>refresh in {request, ttl},<br/>ttlCalls and sectionBudgetBytes at least 1"]
	RULES --> BLOCKS["Every block id non-empty and unique,<br/>kind in the KINDS registry, template non-empty,<br/>vars a dict of strings,<br/>trigger and scope in their unions"]
	SHEMA --> SHIP["The shipped entry ships only enabled false -<br/>the IDLE-forever posture"]
